WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.236
-We're here with Jane Fonda.
And wow.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.004
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:08.708
We're about to play a fun game
called "Best, Worst, First."

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.042
Here we go!

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:13.680
♪ -Best, Worst, First ♪

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.248
-Now, here's how this works.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.416
I will hit this button here,

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:19.051
which activates
a random topic generator.

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:21.388
Okay? It'll land on
a random prompt like

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:25.124
"best pickup line you ever used"
or "worst lie you ever told."

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.126
Whatever it lands on,
you have to say the first thing

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.294
that comes to your mind.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.895
Are you ready for this?

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:32.198
-I hope so.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.201
-Alright, here we go.
First up -- Best.

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:43.476
-My first kiss. My first kiss.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:47.714
I was -- I was in summer stock
in Hyannis Port, Maine,

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.817
and I had a crush
on the stage manager,

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.119
whose name was James Franciscus.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.721
The audience is too young
to know who that was.

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:58.724
He became the star of
"Mr. Novak" on TV.

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:01.160
He was so handsome.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.164
And he walked me out to the end
of a pier and he kissed me.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.832
-Wow.
-And --

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.300
-End of a pier.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.637
-The stars began to whirl.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.805
And the pier began to shake,

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:18.077
and my knees gave way and I slid
down to a pile at his feet.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.745
-Wow!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.880
-I've never had a kiss like that
ever since.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.350
-Holy moly, I've never heard
a story like that.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.886
Oh, my God.
I feel like I had my first kiss.

00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:28.921
[ Cheers and applause ]
Whoo!

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.123
-It was like Hemingway,
you know?

00:01:31.123 --> 00:01:33.459
-Yeah.
-In "The Sun Also Rises."

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:35.661
The Earth shook.
-Oh, my God!

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:37.096
[ Laughter ]
Oh, my God!

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.531
We get it! We get it!
We get it! We get it!

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.799
God!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:41.567
I want to make sure my wife
is not watching tonight.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:42.735
Okay, here we go.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.603
Next round, it's time for Worst.

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:46.338
Here we go. Let's see.
Worst what?

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:48.674
Worst, worst, worst.

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:50.309
Worst. Hold on.

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:54.781
Worst uninvited guest.
Worst uninvited guest.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.849
-Okay, I got one. I got one.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:59.919
This is the worst uninvited
guest into my bedroom.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.054
-Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.691
-My grandson was about
three months old.

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:08.127
I was in a very small cabin
in New Mexico

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:11.197
on a ranch that I had,
and his crib was in the corner.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:15.702
And I was in bed,
and I heard this weird noise,

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.369
like the rattling of a door.

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:19.672
And I got up and I went
into the living room,

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:22.174
and I turned around,
and my Golden Retriever

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:24.843
came running out
whelping and yelling.

00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:26.979
I'm like, "What's this?"
And I go running in.

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:30.249
Whoo! There's a bear!
[ Audience gasps ]

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:33.185
Right in the middle
of my small bedroom,

00:02:33.185 --> 00:02:36.789
heading right for
my grandson's crib!

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.924
-No.
-But I knew what to do.

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:39.993
-You kissed him.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.894
-I opened my bathrobe
and I went...

00:02:41.894 --> 00:02:44.063
[ Screams ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.332
-Come on!
[ Applause ]

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.634
-And this is what happened.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:50.703
The bear urinated on
my antique rug.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:51.838
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:54.640
And then turned around
and sat down.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.877
I roared again,
and it went out to the door

00:02:57.877 --> 00:03:00.579
and it sat down on -- there's
the hole in the screen door

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:01.848
that it came through.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.317
And I pushed it out
and slammed the glass door.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.819
-That's right.
That's exactly what you do.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.788
[ Applause ]
-That's what you do.

00:03:09.788 --> 00:03:12.992
-It got you on the -- Oh, my
gosh, that must have been scary.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:16.963
Alright, last round.
It's time for First...

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.732
And it's going to be
the first...

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.334
Wait. Ooh.

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:25.537
First Zoom.
-Let's see.

00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:30.376
The first in-person rally that
we did, when Fire Drill Fridays

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:34.747
had to move to virtual
because of the pandemic,

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:37.483
and we were really worried
because we didn't know

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:40.486
whether people would continue,
you know, to join us.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:43.690
And so we were really worried.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:48.227
And so we had our first rally,
and it --

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:50.596
it crashed the Internet.

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:53.633
Turned out so many people joined
that we broke the Internet

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:55.601
and the Zoom completely crashed.

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.169
-Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:59.338
These are fantastic!

00:03:59.338 --> 00:04:01.641
Jane Fonda,
you are unbelievable.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.875
Jane Fonda!

